| Component | Vanilla (OpenGL) | VulkanMod (Vulkan) |
|-----------|------------------|-------------------|
| Scissor API | `RenderSystem.enableScissor(x, y, w, h)` | Mixin intercepts → `vkCmdSetScissor` |
| Matrix Source | `GuiGraphics` + `PoseStack` | `PoseStack` available but NOT consumed by scissor path |
| Coordinate Space | Implicitly transformed by GL fixed-function pipeline | Treated as absolute screen-space (BUG) |
| Dynamic State | N/A (OpenGL manages internally) | `VK_DYNAMIC_STATE_SCISSOR` enabled in `PipelineBuilder` |
