## III. Verification Invariants (The "Glass-Box" Check)

The fix is only valid if it meets ALL of these:

| ID | Invariant | Falsifies If |
|----|-----------|--------------|
| INV-A | Moving a GUI element via `matrixStack.translate(dx, dy, 0)` shifts the scissor box by `(dx × guiScale, dy × guiScale)` | `VkRect2D.offset` unchanged after translate |
| INV-B | `vkCmdSetScissor` is called AFTER any matrix transformation within the same draw call boundary | `vkCmdSetScissor` precedes `matrixStack.translate` in the command buffer |
| INV-C | Static GUI elements (no matrix translation) produce identical scissor rects to vanilla | `VkRect2D` differs from vanilla GL scissor for identity matrix |
| INV-D | Nested scissor regions (scissor-within-scissor) respect the intersection of both transformed rects | Inner scissor extends beyond outer scissor bounds after transformation |

### Mathematical requirement:
```
S_vulkan = M_pose × S_vanilla

Where:
  S = Scissor Rect (VkRect2D)
  M = Current PoseStack top matrix (Matrix4f)
  x' = (x × scale) + M.m30  (translationX from matrix)
  y' = (y × scale) + M.m31  (translationY from matrix)
```

